  "description": "*The emperor must be gradually destroyed from within.*\n\nAssassin So-Hwa enters the palace to use a beauty trick on the tyrant Yu Ge-On. However, Yu Ge-On suffers from obsessive-compulsive disorder and madness, which makes him absolutely unwilling to approach women. \n\n*\"If you touch me, you will become dirty too.\"*\n\nOne night, when the emperor's madness is at its peak, So-Hwa stands guard in Yu Ge-On's bedroom and tries to take him down, and Yu Ge-On, who has fallen for So-Hwa, begins to become increasingly obsessed with her.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
